cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Capability-Flag Transit Comparison Simulation
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  conference paper it accompanies.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Java and Spring Boot simulation that compares an Existing and a Proposed
  multimodal public and para-transit system across eight capability flags
  (FR1-FR8), by isolated single-factor ablation and fully stacked comparison,
  together with a repeated-seed analysis and one-at-a-time sensitivity sweeps.
